// Ch16 B01 "The ship waits" (C, 1 min). act2_ch16.md §2 B01. W01: the Hollowmere ship at anchor where the
// sea goes pale. W02: over the side into knee-deep water; Liss leaves Tobin's cracked lamp in its padded box
// on the ship (ADR 0204 §13); Kerrid last over the side, as on a stair.
title: ch16_ship_waits
location: ch16/pale_rim
---
@letterbox on
@camera W01
@music pale_rim fade=2.0
@wait 2.0
Hull_captain as "Ship's captain" [neutral]: This is as far as she floats. We'll wait. As long as it takes. #line:ch16_ship_001
@camera W02
@anim liss give lamp_box
Liss [tender]: Keep it dry. #line:ch16_ship_002 #tn:"'It' is the cracked lamp holding Tobin's light."
@mark toma wade_1 walk
@mark pell wade_2 walk
@mark asha wade_3 walk
@mark ysolde wade_4 walk
@mark liss wade_5 walk
@mark rhen wade_6 walk
@wait 1.5
@mark kerrid wade_7 walk
@wait 2.0
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
